{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209180","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320918001:0":{"text":"You're back, just in time. This is the kid you've been looking for, right? Hurry and take him home.","source_cn":"你们来得正好。这就是你们要找的那孩子吧？赶紧带他回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC7ABFA00B4A2FC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320918002:0":{"text":"I'm not leaving, I'm going to find that lady! She has to be here!","source_cn":"我不走，我要找幽灵大婶！她肯定就在墓园里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E103F87FAAF30BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320918003:1":{"text":"Stop it! I've been guarding this cemetery all night, there's no spirit here!","source_cn":"别胡说！我在墓园里守了一晚上，压根没见着什么幽灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EE6CC15211A354D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320918004:0":{"text":"I'm not lying! This mage saw her too!","source_cn":"我没胡说！这里就是有幽灵，魔法师<male>哥哥</m...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF8C8ADF676CDC3FD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm not lying! This mage saw her too!","female":"I'm not lying! This mage saw her too!","variant_male_record_index":"146586","variant_female_record_index":"146587","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320918005:0":{"text":"... Is there really a spirit here?","source_cn":"……真有幽灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A0219EAF2D70C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320918005":{"text":"... Is there really a spirit here?","source_cn":"……真有幽灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A0219EAF2D70C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320918006:0":{"text":"Fine. If you all saw it, maybe there really is a spirit.","source_cn":"好吧，既然你们也见到了，看来是真的幽灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA12B9175C645B339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320918007:0":{"text":"But she hasn't come back here. If she had, there's no way she could've escaped my watchful eyes.","source_cn":"不过那幽灵确实没往墓园来，否则她不可能躲过我的眼睛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F76ADA5A7CD4FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320918008:0":{"text":"Could her grave be somewhere else? Or did she wander off?","source_cn":"难道她的坟墓不在墓园里？或者她跑去了别的地方……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CD1A14747F8516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320918009:1":{"text":"There aren't any other graves nearby. Why don't you try looking around? I know that spirits don't wander far from their resting places.","source_cn":"据我所知，这附近没有其他坟墓。你们可以在附近找找看，幽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D51F9023751828D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320918010:1":{"text":"But where could she have gone?","source_cn":"可是，她能去哪呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F9C4FBE2F974511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320918011:1":{"text":"Oh! She might be in the <style=\"highlight\">woods nearby</style>! That's where I first saw her earlier.","source_cn":"……啊！有可能在<style=highlight>附近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5F239154D96D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320918012:0":{"text":"Let's go check it out!","source_cn":"那还等什么，我们过去找找吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82430BA61E5FB061","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"I'll tell you what happened...","source_cn":"（讲述刚才发生的事）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11470094866EDC9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'll tell you what happened...","female":"I'll tell you what happened...","variant_male_record_index":"68952",